#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 11
#: rc.cpp:3
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show windows from all desktops"
msgstr "Bar östäl täräzälären kürsätü"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 12
#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option off will cause the taskbar to display <b>only</b> "
"the windows on the current desktop. \\n\\nBy default, this option is selected "
"and all windows are shown."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä sünek bulsa, yöktirä eçendä ağımdağı östälneñ <b>genä</b> "
"täräzäläre kürsätelgän bulaçaq.\n"
"\n"
"Ğädättä isä bu köylämä yanıq tora, şuña kürä bar täräzälär dä kürsätelä."

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 16
#: rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show only minimized windows"
msgstr "Törelgän täräzä genä kürsätü"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 17
#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want the taskbar to display <b>only</b> "
"minimized windows. \\n\\nBy default, this option is not selected and the "
"taskbar will show all windows."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä saylansa, yöktirädä täräzälär törelep quyılğan bulsa <b>ğına</b> "
"kürsäteläçäk.\\n\\nTöpcay bulıp bu köylämä sünek kileş tora, yöktirädä bar "
"täräzälär kürsätelä."

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 22
#: rc.cpp:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Berqayçan"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 25
#: rc.cpp:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "When Taskbar Full"
msgstr "Yöktirä Tulı Bulsa"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 28
#: rc.cpp:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "Always"
msgstr "Barçaqta"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 32
#: rc.cpp:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "Group similar tasks:"
msgstr "Axşaş yöklär törkeme:"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 33
#: rc.cpp:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The taskbar can group similar windows into single buttons. When one of these "
"window group buttons are clicked on a menu appears showing all the windows in "
"that group. This can be especially useful with the <em>Show all windows</em> "
"option.\\n\\nYou can set the taskbar to <strong>Never</strong> "
"group windows, to <strong>Always</strong> group windows or to group windows "
"only <strong>When the Taskbar is Full</strong>.\\n\\nBy default the taskbar "
"groups windows when it is full."
msgstr ""
"Yöktirä axşaş täräzälärne ber töymägä cíıştıra ala. Andí töymälärgä basqanda "
"şul törkemlängän täräzälär tezmäse çığa. <em>Bar täräzälär kürsätü</em> "
"digän köylämä yanıq bulğanda bu köylämädän ayıruça uñaylıq kürep bula.\n"
"\n"
"Yöktirädä täräzälär cíıştıruına kiläse ısullar arasında saylap bula: <strong>"
"Berqayçan</strong>, <strong>Barçaqta</strong>, <strong>"
"Yöktirä Tulı Bulğanda</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"Töpcay bulıp yöktirä tulı bulğanda ğına täräzälär cíıştıru qullanılaçaq."

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 37
#: rc.cpp:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sort windows by desktop"
msgstr "Täräzälärne östäl buyınça tezü"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 38
#: rc.cpp:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting this option causes the taskbar to show windows in order of the "
"desktop they appear on.\\n\\nBy default this option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämäne saylap, yöktirädä täräzälär kürsätü tärtiben alarnıñ östäleneñ "
"tärtibenä tiñ itä.\\n\\nTöpcay bulıp bu köylämä saylanğan kileş tora."

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 42
#: rc.cpp:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sort windows by application"
msgstr "Täräzälärne yazılım buyınça tez"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 43
#: rc.cpp:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting this option causes the taskbar to show windows ordered by "
"application.\\n\\nBy default this option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämäne saylap, yöktirädä täräzälär kürsätü tärtiben yazılımda "
"äytelgänençä itä.\\n\\nTöpcay bulıp bu köylämä saylanğan kileş tora."

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 47
#: rc.cpp:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show application icons"
msgstr "Yazılım tamğaların kürsätü"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 48
#: rc.cpp:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want window icons to appear along with their titles "
"in the taskbar.\\n\\nBy default this option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä saylansa, yöktirädä täräzälär başlığı belän alarnıñ tamğaları da "
"kürsäteläçäk.\\n\\nTöpcay bulıp bu köylämä yanıq tora."

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 64
#: rc.cpp:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show windows from all screens"
msgstr "Bar östäl täräzälären kürsätü"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 65
#: rc.cpp:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option off will cause the taskbar to display <b>only</b> "
"windows which are on the same Xinerama screen as the taskbar.\\n\\nBy default, "
"this option is selected and all windows are shown."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä sünek bulsa, yöktirä eçendä ağımdağı östälneñ <b>genä</b> "
"täräzäläre kürsätelgän bulaçaq.\n"
"\n"
"Ğädättä isä bu köylämä yanıq tora, şuña kürä bar täräzälär dä kürsätelä."

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 74
#: rc.cpp:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show window list button"
msgstr "Täräzä tezmäse töymäsen kürsätü"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 75
#: rc.cpp:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting this option causes the taskbar to display a button that, when "
"clicked, shows a list of all windows in a popup menu."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq bulsa, qoraltirädä bulaçaq töymägä basqanda täräzälär tezmäse "
"belän atılma saylaq kürsäteläçäk."

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 87
#: rc.cpp:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show Task List"
msgstr "Yöklär Tezmäsen Kürsätü"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 90
#: rc.cpp:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show Operations Menu"
msgstr "Eşlätülär Saylağın Kürsätü"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 93
#: rc.cpp:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "Activate, Raise or Minimize Task"
msgstr "Eşçän itü, Kütärelü & Yökne Törep quyu"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 96
#: rc.cpp:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Activate Task"
msgstr "Yökne Eşçän İt"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 99
#: rc.cpp:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Raise Task"
msgstr "Yökne Kütär"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 102
#: rc.cpp:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lower Task"
msgstr "Asqı Yök"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 105
#: rc.cpp:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minimize Task"
msgstr "Yökne Törep quy"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 108
#: rc.cpp:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Move To Current Desktop"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 111
#: rc.cpp:84
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Close Task"
msgstr "Asqı Yök"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 117
#: rc.cpp:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mouse button actions"
msgstr "Küse töymäse ğämäle"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 125
#: rc.cpp:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The number of times to blink a taskbar button when a window asks for attention. "
"Setting this to 1000 or greater causes the button to blink forever."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 130
#: rc.cpp:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draw taskbar entries \"flat\" and not as a button"
msgstr "Qoraltirä keremnären \"taqır\" itep kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 131
#: rc.cpp:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option on will cause the taskbar to draw visible button frames for "
"each entry in the taskbar. \\n\\nBy default, this option is off."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq bulsa, qoraltirä töymäläreneñ qısası sızılğan "
"bulaçaq.\\n\\nTöpcay bulıp bu köylämä sünek tora."

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 135
#: rc.cpp:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draw taskbar text with a halo around it"
msgstr "Qoraltirä yazmaların nurlı itep kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 136
#: rc.cpp:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option on will cause the taskbar to draw fancier text that has an "
"outline around it. While this is useful for transparent panels or particularly "
"dark panel backgrounds, it is slower."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq bulsa, qoraltirä yazmalarınıñ tışı sızılğan bulaçaq. "
"Ütäkürenmäle yä qarañğı tirälärdä bu närsädän uñaylıq kürep bulsa da, ul äkren "
"eşli."

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 140
#: rc.cpp:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show a visible button frame on the task the cursor is positioned over"
msgstr "Östennän küse ütkändä yöktirä töymäseneñ qısa kürsätü"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 144
#: rc.cpp:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show thumbnails instead of icons in the mouse-over effects"
msgstr "Küse ütgändä tamğa urınına töymäsüät kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 145
#: rc.cpp:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will draw a thumbnail of the window in its mouse-over "
"effect."
"<p>If a window is minimized or resides on a different desktop while the taskbar "
"is starting, an icon is shown until the window is restored or the appropriate "
"desktop is activated, respectively.</p>"
msgstr ""
"Enabling this option will draw a thumbnail of the window in its mouse-over "
"effect."
"<p>If a window is minimized or resides on a different desktop while the taskbar "
"is starting, an icon is shown until the window is restored or the appropriate "
"desktop is activated, respectively.</p>"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 149
#: rc.cpp:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum width/height of the thumbnail in pixels"
msgstr "Töymäsürätneñ iñ olı kiñlege/bieklege, taplap"

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 150
#: rc.cpp:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A thumbnail is created by resizing the window. The scaling factor is determined "
"by its largest dimension and this value. In doing so, the thumbnail's size will "
"not exceed this value in any dimension."
msgstr ""
"Täräzäne keçeräytep töymäsürät yasaldı. Bu ülçäm üzgärtü köçe iñ olı ülçäme "
"belän bu bäyägä tayuanıp bilgelände. Şulay itep, töymäsürät ülçämeneñ berärse "
"dä bu bäyädän arta almí."

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 154
#: rc.cpp:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use custom colors for taskbar buttons text and background"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 155
#: rc.cpp:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option on will allow choosing your own colors for taskbar buttons "
"text and background."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 158
#: rc.cpp:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "Color to use for active task button text"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 160
#: rc.cpp:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This color is used for displaying text on taskbar button for task which is "
"active at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 163
#: rc.cpp:132
#, no-c-format
msgid "Color to use for inactive tasks button text"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 165
#: rc.cpp:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This color is used for displaying text on taskbar button for tasks other than "
"active."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 168
#: rc.cpp:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "Color to use for taskbar buttons background"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 170
#: rc.cpp:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "This color is used for displaying background of taskbar buttons."
msgstr ""

